OL,3,GNEWSAParking charges would drive
OL,4,Ashoppers away, businesses fear
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plan, set to be decided later,
OL,7,Fwould also see changes in resident
OL,8,Fpermit charges and increased on-street
OL,9,Fparking fees with a free 30-minute
OL,10,Fperiod, along with the launch of a
OL,11,Fconsultation on a #1 evening parking
OL,12,Frate.
